  "term": "agrammatic comprehension",
  "definition": "Agrammatic comprehension is impaired understanding of sentence grammar or syntax. In this packet, it refers to a comprehension problem seen when a glioma affects specific left frontal brain regions and is accompanied by abnormal activity in syntax-related areas.",
